    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InOut is a level based minimalist puzzle platformer that combines mind bending puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with challenging precision platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.poster.avif?t=1755600018\" width=560 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.webm?t=1755600018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.mp4?t=1755600018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a small, yellow creature with two curious eyes. Not knowing where you are </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or why you're there, you begin to explore uncovering messages that slowly reveal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the truth about your surroundings and your purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.poster.avif?t=1755600018\" width=560 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.webm?t=1755600018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.mp4?t=1755600018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 4 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden areas and secrets to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights with multiple phases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many items to explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InOut is a level based minimalist puzzle platformer that combines mind bending puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with challenging precision platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.poster.avif?t=1755600018\" width=560 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.webm?t=1755600018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/4fab8df9b0df8cd32ad3d49ddd668bcd.mp4?t=1755600018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a small, yellow creature with two curious eyes. Not knowing where you are </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or why you're there, you begin to explore uncovering messages that slowly reveal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the truth about your surroundings and your purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.poster.avif?t=1755600018\" width=560 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.webm?t=1755600018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798350/extras/98f64963c56ebd031f891d70e9375fcc.mp4?t=1755600018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 4 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden areas and secrets to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights with multiple phases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many items to explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A minimalist puzzle platformer where each level is more than\u00a0they\u00a0seem. Change your perspective on levels to discover\u00a0new\u00a0areas. Explore the world to unearth its hidden\u00a0secrets.",
